
% Boulevard of Broken Dreams

a: vi | I | V | ii |
In: $a*2
link: $a*2
Vr_3: $a*2
Vr_1: $a*3
Vr_2: $a*3
b: IV | I | V | vi |
b_cad: IV | I | III |
Ch: $b*3 $b_cad
instr: $b*3 $b_cad
b_cad_2: IV | I | III |
Ch_2: $b*3 $b_cad_2
c: vi | IV | V | II | I | III |
ending_cadence: vi | IV | V | II | I III |
PostCh: $c*3 $ending_cadence
S: [Ab] $In $Vr_1 $Vr_2 $Ch $link $Vr_1 $Vr_2 $Ch $link $instr $Vr_3 $Ch_2 $PostCh
